  <item>
    <title>30 · 一周年回魂超特刊！怪现象对决伪史论</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/685ad5362a38b4d9795a92e3</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">685ad5362a38b4d9795a92e3</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 24 Jun 2025 17:20:08 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>在摸鱼一年之后，拥有太阳碎片的无恙和自比AI苏秦的塔塔终于震撼回归再度开麦！</span></p><span></span><p><span>伪史论、爹味文化、办公室谣言、躺平派，等等等等后现代式的生活意义解构流派群魔乱舞，但这一切的根源就只是这些表面上的怪现象么？当然不是！</span></p><span></span><p><span>可在这个宏大不再的时代，普通人又能够怎么办呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span>回归之作，重磅来袭！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【本期执麦人】</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><a href="https://weibo.com/u/1804825813" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/1804825813"><span>无恙：太阳碎片持有者</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://weibo.com/u/6744288606" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/6744288606"><span>塔塔：AI苏秦</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>无关又有关的微信公众号：</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/nzEf2NYeKZFtukXkxLo58A" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/nzEf2NYeKZFtukXkxLo58A"><span>《延迟更新》</span></a></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>【本期耳点】</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>论伪史论大V的倒掉</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>疑古与辨史</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>从伪史论到爹味再到宏大叙事的缺失</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>意义不再时代的无力反抗</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>【制作】</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>配乐：Gemini 2.5 Pro + Suno V4.5</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>配图：Gemini 2.5 Pro + Grok 3</span></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
