  <item>
    <title>29 · 年终与年末的吐吐槽：真人秀里的工具人生</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6781ee181bf3f0ab2b608e2f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6781ee181bf3f0ab2b608e2f</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 11 Jan 2025 04:19:05 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>24刚逝，25渐新，在划水了小半年后，我们终于又更新了。</span><br><span>而更新的缘起，则是因为豆瓣年报提醒了我们：已经摸鱼太久啦，播客都长水草啦！</span><br><span>我们在此保证，2025年争取做到周更，或者半月更，至少月更，保底季更，实在不行也要做到随缘……</span></p><span></span><p><span>这次，我们打算从4年看过的那些书，追过的那些剧，吐槽过的那些电影与综艺入手，来开启我们槽意满满的一年。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【本期执麦人】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://weibo.com/u/1804825813" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/1804825813"><span>无恙：太阳碎片持有者</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://weibo.com/u/6744288606" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/6744288606"><span>塔塔：AI哺育师</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>无关又有关的微信公众号：</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/nzEf2NYeKZFtukXkxLo58A" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/nzEf2NYeKZFtukXkxLo58A"><span>《延迟更新》</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【本期耳点】</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>苍白的开场白 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="39">00:39</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="99">01:39</a> </span><br><span>哈啦两句有的没的，并对长期划水做出装装样子的深刻检讨</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>聊聊年度破圈综艺 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="256">04:16</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="969">16:09</a> </span><br><span>聊聊《再见爱人》带来的冲击和引发的讨论，并对节目内外人物的行为做出无法理解状</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>真人秀与真有关么？ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="969">16:09</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2509">41:49</a> </span><br><span>真人秀等综艺节目的本质，就在于“真”，的对立面，镜头内外的所有人物都只是节目组为了博取流量与资金的提线木偶</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>年度内容消费回顾 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2509">41:49</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3262">54:22</a> </span><br><span>回顾今年观看的电影和电视剧，顺便吐吐槽</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>年度阅读习惯对比 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3262">54:22</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4346">01:12:26</a> </span><br><span>聊聊那些读过的书，以及一些别的有的没的</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>若有似无的新年期望 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4346">01:12:26</a> </span><br><span>我们应该会更新的，吧……</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>【关于BGM】</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>OP&amp;ED：</span><br><span>作词：本期播客 + Gemini 2.0</span><br><span>编曲：Claude Sonnet 3.5 + Suno V4</span><br><span>演唱：Suno V4</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>其他BGM：</span><br><span>编曲：Claude Sonnet 3.5 + Suno V4</span></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
