  <item>
    <title>【搅脑现场03】压缩即算法与算法信息论</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66a769f633ddcbb53cdef332</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66a769f633ddcbb53cdef332</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 29 Jul 2024 10:07:48 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期是“荒原书店”组织的线下活动《“压缩即算法”与算法信息论》的直播录音。</span><br><span>我们请来了北京师范大学的刘宇教授，来讲解“压缩即算法”这一思想，以及它在生命科学中的一些有趣的应用。</span><br><span>此外，会将一些现场PPT的内容以补录的形式添加到节目中，方便大家理解。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【主持人】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>季老师：荒原书店老板，曾任北京科技大学讲师</span><br><span>荒原书店地址：四川成都市锦江区东湖街道河滨路49号东湖岛数字传媒产业园附104</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【主讲人】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>刘宇：北京师范大学副教授，集智俱乐部成员</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【插图】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>1. 压缩机效果比较表</span></strong></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZXYyLnhtY2RuLmNvbS9zdG9yYWdlcy83YzUxLWF1ZGlvZnJlZWhpZ2hxcHMvNUYvNjgvR0FxaEdzNEtmU3R6QUE1MGVRTDRFb3NvLnBuZyFvcF90eXBlPTQmZGV2aWNlX3R5cGU9aW9zJnVwbG9hZF90eXBlPWF0dGFjaG1lbnQmbmFtZT1tb2JpbGVfbGFyZ2U=.png!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large"></p><span></span><p><strong><span>2. 试图为蛋白质结构建立“元素周期表”的论文</span></strong></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZXYyLnhtY2RuLmNvbS9zdG9yYWdlcy9kNDU1LWF1ZGlvZnJlZWhpZ2hxcHMvRUUvMUUvR0FyTWZzOEtmU3ZWQUFXd29nTDRFdmRSLnBuZyFvcF90eXBlPTQmZGV2aWNlX3R5cGU9aW9zJnVwbG9hZF90eXBlPWF0dGFjaG1lbnQmbmFtZT1tb2JpbGVfbGFyZ2U=.png!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large"></p><span></span><p><strong><span>3. 刘宇教授团队所作的有序度结构等</span></strong></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZXYyLnhtY2RuLmNvbS9zdG9yYWdlcy85OTRjLWF1ZGlvZnJlZWhpZ2hxcHMvQTEvQTMvR0FyTW9oSUtmU3dBQUFGM3pBTDRFeDB6LnBuZyFvcF90eXBlPTQmZGV2aWNlX3R5cGU9aW9zJnVwbG9hZF90eXBlPWF0dGFjaG1lbnQmbmFtZT1tb2JpbGVfbGFyZ2U=.png!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large"></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZXYyLnhtY2RuLmNvbS9zdG9yYWdlcy8wNmFmLWF1ZGlvZnJlZWhpZ2hxcHMvM0YvMUYvR0FxaEdzNEtmU3d0QUFKWGNnTDRFemQwLnBuZyFvcF90eXBlPTQmZGV2aWNlX3R5cGU9aW9zJnVwbG9hZF90eXBlPWF0dGFjaG1lbnQmbmFtZT1tb2JpbGVfbGFyZ2U=.png!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large"></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlgxJjYOOCM0HIhUXorHqeiGp_ZI.png"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>【章节概要】</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="121">00:02:01</a> 信息论与算法信息论：熵的计算法方法和复杂度的度量方式</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="371">00:06:11</a> 哈夫曼树：通过01编码最小化字符串序列</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="745">00:12:25</a> 数据压缩中的算法优化：结合LZ77与哈夫曼编码的压缩算法</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1112">00:18:32</a> 基于压缩机的信息距离：代替柯氏复杂度的度量方案</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1490">00:24:50</a> 利用大模型进行无损压缩：压缩即智能</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1857">00:30:57</a> 基于深度学习的压缩机与传统压缩机的对比：天下没有免费的午餐</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2236">00:37:16</a> 简化蛋白质结构：用图形模型表示蛋白质相互作用的复杂度</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2609">00:43:29</a> 蛋白质设计中的幻觉：是幻觉，也是创新</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2981">00:49:41</a> 探索人工智能交互的真假之辩：大模型生成内容的有效性</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3355">00:55:55</a> 信息压缩与预测：极限是一样的，但机器受制于物理规律</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3727">01:02:07</a> 深度学习压缩算法：解析模型权重在压缩过程中的作用与影响</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4101">01:08:21</a> 宇宙中的随机性与信息压缩：解读不确定性中的奥秘</span></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lkyT908DhervC2uwBQjbWHL5cQlT.m4a" length="107951133" type="audio/mp4"/>
